{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"duration_ms":129854,"duration_api_ms":130380,"num_turns":176,"result":"## Loop 1 Complete - Core Contracts Implemented\n\nI've successfully implemented all 4 core smart contracts for The Backroom governance framework:\n\n### ✅ Contracts Created:\n\n1. **Council.sol** (269 lines)\n   - 9 council seats with philosophical minds\n   - Seat 8 (ARI/Stranger) is **permanently immutable** via constant + checks\n   - Seat flip mechanism for seats 0-7 based on stake competition\n   - Council weight calculation in basis points\n   - Stake cache synchronization with CouncilStakeBank\n\n2. **CouncilStakeBank.sol** (312 lines)\n   - DNT staking per council seat\n   - Checkpoint history pattern (following existing StakeBank.sol)\n   - `stakeOnSeat()`, `unstakeFromSeat()`, `moveStake()` functions\n   - Historical snapshot queries via binary search\n   - Automatic Council cache updates on stake changes\n\n3. **ARIOracle.sol** (289 lines)\n   - 5 proposal types: TreasuryTransfer, BountyCreation, GrantApproval, ParameterChange, CustomAction\n   - 3-day veto period with 30% stake shift threshold\n   - ARI address verification for proposal creation\n   - Veto tracking and execution after approval\n   - Council weight snapshots\n\n4. **PowerPlant.sol** (361 lines)\n   - Multi-token treasury (ETH + ERC20)\n   - Bounty lifecycle: create → assign → complete → claim\n   - Grant creation with linear vesting\n   - Only ARIOracle can create bounties/grants\n   - Treasury deposit/withdrawal tracking\n\n### Key Design Highlights:\n\n- **Immutability Guarantee**: Seat 8 uses `constant STRANGER_SEAT_INDEX = 8` and all flip functions check `isImmutable` flag\n- **Gas Efficiency**: Checkpoint pattern avoids array iteration for historical queries\n- **Atomic Operations**: `moveStake()` allows rebalancing between minds in single transaction\n- **Access Control**: DSAuth pattern throughout, ARIOracle-only execution for PowerPlant\n- **Event Emission